{
  "format": "craftbridge.mappings",
  "version": 2,
  "name": "bridge-median-1",
  "plugins": [
    {
      "api": 1,
      "id": "org.craftbridge.median",
      "name": "Bridge Median (Approximate)",
      "category": "Craft Bridge",
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "author": "Craft Preset Bridge contributors",
      "description": "Original oriented rectangular neighborhood filtering with four channel modes and bounded sampling. Geometry, fractional response, color/alpha and compositing are not certified against BCC; masks remain unresolved.",
      "params": [
        {
          "id": "mode",
          "name": "Mode",
          "type": "popup",
          "default": 2,
          "options": [
            "Selected Channel Only",
            "Pixel Selected by Channel",
            "A R G B Separately",
            "Most Common Pixel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "channel",
          "name": "Channel",
          "type": "popup",
          "default": 0,
          "options": [
            "Luminance",
            "Lightness",
            "Brightness",
            "Hue",
            "Saturation",
            "Alpha",
            "Red",
            "Green",
            "Blue"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "preserve_alpha",
          "name": "Preserve Alpha",
          "type": "checkbox",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "id": "length",
          "name": "Raw Median Length",
          "type": "slider",
          "default": 5,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 512
        },
        {
          "id": "width",
          "name": "Raw Median Width",
          "type": "slider",
          "default": 5,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 512
        },
        {
          "id": "angle",
          "name": "Median Angle",
          "type": "slider",
          "default": 0,
          "min": -36000,
          "max": 36000
        },
        {
          "id": "fractional",
          "name": "Enable Fractional Radius",
          "type": "checkbox",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "id": "level",
          "name": "Raw Median Level",
          "type": "slider",
          "default": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "softness",
          "name": "Raw Softness",
          "type": "slider",
          "default": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "mix",
          "name": "Raw Mix with Original",
          "type": "slider",
          "default": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "mappings": [
    {
      "source": "BCC3Median",
      "source_format": "ffx",
      "target": "effectcraft",
      "effect": "org.craftbridge.median",
      "params": {
        "BCC3Median-0852": {
          "target": "mode",
          "kind": "Choice",
          "operation": "minus_one"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0851": {
          "target": "channel",
          "kind": "Choice",
          "operation": "minus_one"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0803": {
          "target": "preserve_alpha",
          "kind": "Bool",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0801": {
          "target": "length",
          "kind": "Float",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0806": {
          "target": "width",
          "kind": "Float",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0805": {
          "target": "angle",
          "kind": "Float",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0804": {
          "target": "fractional",
          "kind": "Bool",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0802": {
          "target": "level",
          "kind": "Float",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0807": {
          "target": "softness",
          "kind": "Float",
          "operation": "identity"
        },
        "BCC3Median-0520": {
          "target": "mix",
          "kind": "Float",
          "operation": "identity"
        }
      },
      "validation": "real-source-descriptors; original-renderer-approximate",
      "evidence": "Three local BCC3Median complete parT/tdb4 snapshots, exact IDs/kinds/menu order and degrees; official Boris FX functional description; ADR 022; no proprietary code/assets reused",
      "target_commit": "e38a92e792c07f1c57c5dcfcab37d91932b9e2b8",
      "limitations": [
        "Mediana e janela retangular orientada usam algoritmo original; discretização, bordas replicadas e amostragem de até 36 taps por pixel (distribuídos entre até quatro kernels fracionários) não certificam o kernel BCC.",
        "Length/Width/Level/Softness/Mix permanecem coeficientes brutos; raios raw*scale/2, mistura /100 e interpolação fracionária usam calibração própria, sem unidade de origem inferida.",
        "Métricas RGB/HSV, alpha, quantização de Most Common Pixel e limites HDR são próprios; não há equivalência visual comprovada.",
        "Compare Mode, Compositing, PixelChooser/Mocha, tracking e referências opacas continuam perdas; não se presume máscara vazia nem composição equivalente. Sempre parcial; strict não publica."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
